WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.000
My life

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:07.240
hasn't been what you probably
think it has.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.240
We all have our struggles.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:12.680
Have you ever
been in love?

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.780
A long long time ago.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:17.960
You?

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:20.200
So many times. Yeah. All the time.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.980
Welcome to the future.

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:34.420
Life is good

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:35.920
but it can be better

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.540
and why shouldn't it be?

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:42.280
All you need is to want it.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:53.540
Think about finally having everything
you always wanted.

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:56.800
I can save today

00:00:57.980 --> 00:00:59.660
but you can save the world.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:01.940
Steve.

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:03.220
Diana.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.880
Now

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:12.960
I take what I want in return.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.640
Everyone will see

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:36.660
The world needs you.

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:40.840
You know you need to do.

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:51.080
Nothing good is born from lies

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.960
and greatness is not what you think.

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:14.640
It's all art.

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:19.300
Ah, that's just a trash can.

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:20.400
This is just a trash can.

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:21.200
Yeah yeah yeah.

